# ─── Databases ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite databases are ignored by default...
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ...except the seeded analytical database, which is COMMITTED ON PURPOSE.
# It is the project's only copy of the ~17,200 cleaned CIHI rows: schema.sql
# creates the tables but leaves them empty, and load_csv.py cannot refill them
# (it reads data/optimized/, which does not exist). Deleting this file leaves
# every dashboard, hypothesis test, and chart with no data.
# See README.md → "Database & Data Provenance".
!backend/database/healthcare.db

# Local working notes on data/statistics defects — not for distribution.
MEMORY.md

# Local module/library audit report generated from graphify — not for distribution.
PIPELINE_MODULES_REPORT.md

# Local backend-statistics study notes — not for distribution.
BACKEND_STATISTICS_NOTES.md

# Local dashboard engineering roadmap — not for distribution.
DASHBOARD_ROADMAP.md

# Local deployment/implementation guide (HTTPS, nginx, AWS) — not for distribution.
guide_to_implement.md

# ─── Claude Code ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .claude/ and CLAUDE.md are local-only — kept out of the repo.
# Files remain on disk; only removed from git tracking.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# graphify's generated knowledge graph. Regenerated from source by `/graphify .`
# and refreshed with `graphify update .`, so it is derived data: large, and graph.json
# would conflict on nearly every merge. Each developer builds their own.
#
# GRAPH_REPORT.md is the exception, committed on purpose: it is the human-readable
# architecture overview, it diffs legibly, and it is useful in the capstone write-up.
#
# Note the pattern is `graphify-out/*`, not `graphify-out/`. Git cannot re-include a
# file inside an excluded *directory*, so the trailing-slash form would make the
# negation below silently do nothing.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md

# ─── Other AI tools ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Auto-generated by IDE/agent tooling other than Claude Code (e.g. GitHub Copilot),
# mirroring the graphify setup above for that tool. Local/editor-generated, not
# something authored for this project — kept out of the official repo.
.agents/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
